        "rationale": "Hand-authored USDM v4 fragment. REGENERATED 2026-09-16 from the ICH M11-restructured protocol in study/m11/protocol/ rather than transcribed from prose: objectives and endpoints from section-03-objectives-endpoints.md, study identity from section-00-title-page.md, laboratory BCs from section-12-01-clinical-laboratory-tests.md. Estimands now derive from M11 protocol 3.1.1 and 3.2.1, where M11 requires them, rather than from SAP 13. Not a full study definition: no schedule of activities, no eligibility criteria, no interventions beyond the arms. 2026-09-19: second endpoint END-S5-VS (systolic blood pressure) and BC C25298 added from study/m11/protocol/section-08-04-02-vital-signs.md.",
